{"en":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt23\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> The act of persons or things that <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/meet\" title=\"meet\">meet</a>.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"<b>Meeting</b> him will be exciting. I enjoy <b>meeting</b> new people."}],"examples":["<b>Meeting</b> him will be exciting. I enjoy <b>meeting</b> new people."]},{"definition":"A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/gathering\" title=\"gathering\">gathering</a> of persons for a purpose; an <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/assembly\" title=\"assembly\">assembly</a>.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"We need to have a <b>meeting</b> about that soon."}],"examples":["We need to have a <b>meeting</b> about that soon."]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt28\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> The people at such a gathering.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"What has the <b>meeting</b> decided."}],"examples":["What has the <b>meeting</b> decided."]},{"definition":"An <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/encounter\" title=\"encounter\">encounter</a> between people, even accidental.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"They came together in a chance <b>meeting</b> on the way home from work."}],"examples":["They came together in a chance <b>meeting</b> on the way home from work."]},{"definition":"A place or instance of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/junction\" title=\"junction\">junction</a> or intersection; a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/confluence\" title=\"confluence\">confluence</a>.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"Earthquakes occur at the <b>meeting</b> of tectonic plates."}],"examples":["Earthquakes occur at the <b>meeting</b> of tectonic plates."]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt32\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/religious\" title=\"religious\">religious</a> service held by 